  "description": "Result pattern implementation for functional error handling in C#.\n      Provides Result<T> and Result types for railway-oriented programming, eliminating\n      exceptions for expected failures.\n      Foundation for functional programming patterns and robust error handling.\n      Bundles analyzers and code fixes for the typed results (CSE5001-CSE5006) and a source generator\n      that registers typed result JSON converters for Native AOT.",
